    "extraction_notes": [
      "The p. 4 forward-characteristic points are digitized from the T_J = 25 degC curve at visible current-decade intersections; the figure is a family curve, not ZMM3V6-exclusive.",
      "The table labels 3.6 V as V_Znom at I_ZT = 5 mA. It is classified as typical because the strict schema has no nominal source kind; the same row gives the 3.4 V to 3.8 V specified range.",
      "For ZMM3V6, Z_ZT is 85 ohm maximum at I_ZT = 5 mA and Z_ZK is 600 ohm maximum at I_ZK = 1 mA; these maximum impedance values are not substituted for a nominal reverse I-V point.",
      "No junction-capacitance or reverse-recovery-time value is published."
